# Play test of the plan 'The Last Green World' (CIPlay plan_last_green_world, in a test world 'CI ...' set to day 6
# first with CISetDay 6, for Thornback Ridge's day:6): a main story in place of Raft's - each island's frequency comes by
# its rule (a quest, a visit, a step, a zone, a signal), it is tuned to on the Receiver and played to its end with its
# own test. At the Heart the BURN valve is turned, so at the Rootcore only the BURN core valve works.
plan The Last Green World
tune spit
include pollenreach_spit.play
tune landing
include ranger_landing.play
tune delta
include riverfork_delta.play
tune rise
include trackers_rise.play
tune grove
include hollowtrunk_grove.play
tune caves
include rootweave_caves.play
tune mire
include blightmire.play
tune canopy
include canopy_stair.play
tune heart
include heart_of_green.play
tune rootcore
include the_rootcore.play
arrive ridge
include thornback_ridge.play
expect blueprints
plan end
